.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH devin-forward 1  "forward " 
.SH NAME
devin\-forward \- Forward ports from a cloud Devin session\*(Aqs box to localhost
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdevin forward\fR [\fB\-\-gateway\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISESSION\fR> <\fIPORTS\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Forward ports from a cloud Devin session\*(Aqs box to localhost
.PP
Opens a tunnel to the Devin SSH gateway and forwards each port so a dev server running on the box can be opened at http://localhost:<port>. Runs until Ctrl\-C.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-gateway\fR \fI<GATEWAY>\fR
SSH gateway host (defaults to the ssh. host of your Devin API)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fISESSION\fR>
Session id or session URL
.TP
<\fIPORTS\fR>
Ports on the box to forward, as `<port>` or `<local>:<port>` (e.g. `3000` or `8080:3000`)
